/// \fn ModuleData *W3DSailModelDrawModuleData::friend_newModuleData(INI *ini)
/// \brief Data factory registered for "W3DSailModelDraw": creates the module
///        data and parses the INI block into it.
///
/// Same pattern as W3DHordeModelDrawModuleData::friend_newModuleData. The
